second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is Philippa Rous's spouse?\", \"slot_hint\": \"person\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 13, \"text\": \"Philippa Rous\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 15, \"end\": 148, \"text\": \"Philippa Rous (born 1960) is a British socialite and philanthropist, best known for her marriage to American businessman Paul Pelosi.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 149, \"end\": 173, \"text\": \"Early Life and Education\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 175, \"end\": 268, \"text\": \"Philippa Rous was born on August 12, 1960, in London, England, to a prominent British family.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 269, \"end\": 361, \"text\": \"She received her early education at the prestigious Wycombe Abbey School in Buckinghamshire.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 362, \"end\": 452, \"text\": \"Rous later attended the University of Edinburgh, where she earned a degree in Art History.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 453, \"end\": 476, \"text\": \"Marriage to Paul Pelosi\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 478, \"end\": 560, \"text\": \"In 1995, Rous married Paul Pelosi, a successful American businessman and investor.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 561, \"end\": 657, \"text\": \"The couple met at a charity gala in San Francisco, California, and became engaged shortly after.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 658, \"end\": 800, \"text\": \"Their wedding, held at the Rous family estate in Scotland, was attended by numerous high-society guests and received extensive media coverage.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 801, \"end\": 823, \"text\": \"Studies and References\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 825, \"end\": 1060, \"text\": \"A 2001 study published in the Journal of Social Dynamics found that the marriage between Rous and Pelosi was a prime example of transatlantic social networking, highlighting the couple's ability to bridge cultural and economic divides.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1061, \"end\": 1064, \"text\": \"[1]\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1066, \"end\": 1246, \"text\": \"In 2010, Rous was featured in a profile piece by Vogue magazine, which described her as a \\\"style icon\\\" and praised her philanthropic work in the fields of education and healthcare.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1247, \"end\": 1250, \"text\": \"[2]\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1252, \"end\": 1428, \"text\": \"A 2015 article in The New York Times noted that Rous and Pelosi were among the top donors to the Democratic Party, contributing over $1 million to various campaigns and causes.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1429, \"end\": 1432, \"text\": \"[3]\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1434, \"end\": 1553, \"text\": \"In 2018, Rous was honored with the Order of the British Empire for her services to charity and international relations.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1554, \"end\": 1557, \"text\": \"[4]\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1559, \"end\": 1569, \"text\": \"References\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1571, \"end\": 1584, \"text\": \"[1] Smith, J.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1585, \"end\": 1592, \"text\": \"(2001).\"}, \"D1S23\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1593, \"end\": 1653, \"text\": \"Transatlantic Social Networking: A Study of Elite Marriages.\"}, \"D1S24\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1654, \"end\": 1697, \"text\": \"Journal of Social Dynamics, 35(2), 123-145.\"}, \"D1S25\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1698, \"end\": 1708, \"text\": \"[2] Vogue.\"}, \"D1S26\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1709, \"end\": 1727, \"text\": \"(2010, September).\"}, \"D1S27\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1728, \"end\": 1773, \"text\": \"Philippa Rous: A Life of Style and Substance.\"}, \"D1S28\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1774, \"end\": 1846, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.vogue.com\\\\/article\\\\/philippa-rous-profile>\"}, \"D1S29\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1848, \"end\": 1871, \"text\": \"[3] The New York Times.\"}, \"D1S30\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1872, \"end\": 1891, \"text\": \"(2015, October 25).\"}, \"D1S31\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1892, \"end\": 1927, \"text\": \"Top Donors to the Democratic Party.\"}, \"D1S32\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1928, \"end\": 2045, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.nytimes.com\\\\/interactive\\\\/2015\\\\/10\\\\/25\\\\/us\\\\/politics\\\\/top-donors-democratic-party.html>\"}, \"D1S33\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2047, \"end\": 2070, \"text\": \"[4] The London Gazette.\"}, \"D1S34\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2071, \"end\": 2086, \"text\": \"(2018, June 8).\"}, \"D1S35\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2087, \"end\": 2114, \"text\": \"Birthday Honours List 2018.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 95, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Aristocratic Union Confirmed - Philippa Rous Ties the Knot with Anthony Eyre**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 97, \"end\": 275, \"text\": \"In a union that has sent ripples through the British aristocracy, Philippa Rous, born in 1960, has been confirmed to be married to Anthony Eyre, a member of the esteemed peerage.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 276, \"end\": 427, \"text\": \"This news has been substantiated through rigorous research and credible sources, putting to rest any speculation surrounding the couple's relationship.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 428, \"end\": 576, \"text\": \"According to records from the Peerage, a trusted authority on British nobility, Anthony Eyre's person ID (707058) lists Philippa Rous as his spouse.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 577, \"end\": 678, \"text\": \"This concrete evidence solidifies the claim, leaving no doubt about the legitimacy of their marriage.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 679, \"end\": 928, \"text\": \"Lady Victoria Hervey, a close acquaintance of the couple, spoke exclusively to our publication, saying, \\\"I've had the pleasure of knowing Philippa and Anthony for many years, and I can confidently say that their bond is one of deep love and respect.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 929, \"end\": 1004, \"text\": \"They make a wonderful couple, and I'm thrilled to see them happy together.\\\"\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1005, \"end\": 1153, \"text\": \"Further validation comes from the couple's social circle, where they have been spotted attending high-society events and charity functions together.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1154, \"end\": 1323, \"text\": \"A source close to the family revealed, \\\"Philippa and Anthony are often seen at aristocratic gatherings, where they mingle effortlessly with other members of the peerage.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1324, \"end\": 1388, \"text\": \"Their marriage is a beautiful blend of tradition and modernity.\\\"\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1389, \"end\": 1516, \"text\": \"Data from reputable genealogical sources also supports the claim, tracing the couple's family lines and confirming their union.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1517, \"end\": 1627, \"text\": \"\\\"Our research has uncovered a wealth of information about Philippa Rous and Anthony Eyre's families,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1628, \"end\": 1679, \"text\": \"Emma Taylor, a leading expert in British genealogy.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1680, \"end\": 1833, \"text\": \"\\\"Their marriage is a testament to the enduring legacy of the aristocracy, and we're delighted to have played a part in verifying this significant union.\\\"\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1834, \"end\": 1954, \"text\": \"In conclusion, our investigation has yielded conclusive evidence that Philippa Rous is, indeed, married to Anthony Eyre.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1955, \"end\": 2083, \"text\": \"This news is a testament to the power of rigorous research and the importance of verifying information through credible sources.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Paul Pelosi\", \"Anthony Eyre\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Paul Pelosi\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Anth